{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32141","headline":"晚归曲 · 温庭筠","name":"晚归曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"格格水禽飞带波，孤光斜起夕阳多。\n湖西山浅似相笑，菱刺惹衣攒黛蛾。\n青丝系船向江木，兰芽出土吴江曲。\n水极晴摇泛灩红，草平春染烟绵绿。\n玉鞭骑马杨叛儿，刻金作凤光参差。\n丁丁暖漏滴花影，催入景阳人不知。\n弯堤弱柳遥相瞩，雀扇团圆掩香玉。\n莲塘艇子归不归，柳暗桑穠闻布谷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}